@startuml
title Variant B — Durable workflow and primary push delivery
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "Bank service\n+ source outbox" as Bank
participant "Ingress API" as API
database "Business registry" as DB
participant "Start / Signal Relay" as Relay
participant "Temporal Server\n+ durable history" as T
participant "Workflow Worker" as W
participant "Activity Worker" as A
participant "FCM / APNs" as P
participant "Mobile app" as App
participant "Receipt API" as R

Bank -> Bank : Commit transaction + outbox
Bank -> API : Submit stable event_id
API -> DB : Commit event key, notification, start-outbox
API --> Bank : 202 notification_id (t0)
Relay -> DB : Read start-outbox
Relay -> T : StartWorkflow(id = notification_id)
T -> T : Persist start; reject duplicate execution
T --> Relay : Started / already exists
Relay -> DB : Mark start-outbox done
T -> W : Workflow task (polled)
W -> T : Schedule policy Activity, then SendPush + deadline
T -> A : Activity task (polled)
A -> DB : Reserve stable attempt_id
A -> P : Send push
P --> A : Accepted + provider_message_id
A -> DB : Commit attempt result
A -> T : Activity completed: PROVIDER_ACCEPTED
P -> App : Push
App -> App : Deduplicate; persist local inbox
App -> R : Authenticated ACK
R -> DB : Commit receipt + signal-outbox
R --> App : 200
Relay -> T : Signal receipt_id, notification_id, evidence
T -> T : Persist signal
T --> Relay : Signal accepted
Relay -> DB : Mark signal-outbox done
T -> W : Resume with receipt signal
W -> T : Confirm; cancel timer; schedule projection Activity
T -> A : Update projection (idempotent)
A -> DB : Commit CONFIRMED + audit
A -> T : Activity complete
W -> T : Complete workflow
@enduml
